							"description": "Firearm (Artillery) Specialized Cartridge - Liquid Nitrogen",
							"reference": "HT177",
							"local_notes": "Remove the fragmentation effect of the grenade. \n\nThis ammunition deals an extra cumulative 1d-2 damage to FP for every 2 levels of Arts Casting with equivalent HP damage via Frostbite to all exposed body hit locations at the aoe epicenter (Gurps High Tech p.63).  Damaged targets are afflicted with Thermal Shock (Gurps Basic Set p.430).  Targets take additional HP damage through Frostbite based on the FP loss from their Thermal Shock save.",
